Upstream patch dwm-scratchpads-20200414-728d397b.diff
(https://dwm.suckless.org/patches/scratchpads/), merged by hand into this dwm,
with FDWM's two scratchpads: Alt+` a terminal (st -n spterm) and Alt+N Neovim
on ~/notes.md (st -n spnotes), both floating at 120x34 and centered. Unlike
the patch, the tag-count check counts the scratchpads' tags, and Alt+0 and
Alt+Shift+0 leave them out.

